From 59480672a49362a60a1aea4e022aeed3f72d7517 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brandon Thompson <brandon.joseph.thompson@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 08:36:44 -0700
Subject: Patch: Add CPU/RAM/temp and network speed widgets to the Noctalia
 bar.

Adapted for beta-18: system stats (BarStats) is already wired in,
unconditionally, on the left of the shared band-skin branch (noctalia,
caelestia, aegis, stele, triptych) -- broader than this patch's
noctalia-only scope, with no toggle. Left that alone rather than
fighting an upstream design already in place; dropped the barShowStats
setting this patch would have added.

Net speed (BarNetSpeed/NetSpeed/NetSpeedPopout) is genuinely new --
nothing on beta-18 surfaces a bar-visible throughput readout outside
the unrelated atoll style's own popout -- so it's ported in full,
right side ahead of status like the original, including the
mediaCramped logic that drops now-playing to its art thumb when the
row would crowd the centred clock. The right cluster's module set grew
(status/weather/toggles/tray/power vs. the original's status/tray/
power), so rightOtherCount/rightFixedWidth account for all of them.
